### Tuquet Automa Runner - Browser Profiles & Manual Sessions
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8765
@contentType = application/json

### 4.1 Danh sach Browser Profiles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/browsers

### 4.2 Tao Browser Profile moi
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/browsers
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Default Test Profile",
  "browserType": "chromium",
  "headless": false
}

### 4.3 Mo trinh duyet truc tiep (Manual session)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/browsers/default/session
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "headless": false
}

### 4.4 Dong phien trinh duyet manual
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/browsers/default/session

### 4.5 Don sach tat ca tien trinh Chromium dang chay
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/browsers/sessions
